<title>SPAIN: Spain's Unicaja buys one pct of Sevillana.</title>
<headline>Spain's Unicaja buys one pct of Sevillana.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Unicaja bought one percent of electricity firm Sevillana with a promise to raise its stake to three percent this year, Sevillana said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Unicaja's chairman Braulio Medel will take a place on the Sevillana board of directors. Shareholders are expected to approve a reduction in the board of directors to 17 from 20.</p>
<p>&quot;Unicaja has bought one percent of Sevillana, which will rise to two percent shortly and will reach three percent in the year,&quot; Sevillana chairman Fernando Ybarra told a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
